{{- if $vscode }}
- VS Code: `code`.
{{- end }}
{{- if $workstation }}
- Kitty is the terminal; tmux runs sessions (default prefix `Ctrl-b`).
{{- else }}
- tmux runs sessions (default prefix `Ctrl-b`); the user connects from Kitty.
{{- end }}
{{- if $fedora }}
- Desktop: KDE Plasma on Wayland with the Dusk colour scheme, which
  matches the Kitty, tmux and Starship colours.
{{- if $workstation }}
- Boot: the Plymouth splash uses the Dusk Ridge theme
  (`~/.local/share/boot-theme`); GRUB stays stock. See `docs/VISUALS.md` in
